## EdVidura Strict Frontend Lock Rule

- **ALL user-facing UI screens must be built exclusively inside `frontend-react/src/` using `AppShell`, `TopNav`, `PageHeading`, and the established design tokens.**
- **Never create parallel frontend folders, alternate themes, or raw HTML/Jinja templates for user-facing views.**
- Maintain full design system consistency with the established card, table, navigation, and color tokens.
- Canonical cloud review entry URL: `https://edvidura-deployment.vercel.app/review`.
